SNU Jaha

SNU Jaha is a derivative font prepared by Hyeshik Chang. The Regular build
keeps Korean and East Asian glyphs from RIDIBatang and imports non-CJK glyphs
and OpenType layout features from Roboto Serif 14pt Regular.

